{"c":{"139631":["Miko Yotsuya","Female","b139631-JC76pYY2Q51Z.png","Miko has the ability to see frightening supernatural things that most people can't, but she pretends that she can't see them to avoid conflict.",2486],"139632":["Hana Yurikawa","Female","b139632-b95rh3VplAYY.png","Miko's close friend. She is clueless of the supernatural terrors that afflict her friend, but she does unknowingly attract a lot of them due to her unusual amount of life energy.",412],"156860":["Yulia Niguredou","Female","b156860-P5bAY1m97tX7.png","An aspiring spirit medium who believes she's somewhat special because she has the power to see spirits. However, she doesn't know that she can only see lesser spirits, and misinterprets Miko's attempts to protect her from the greater dangers she cannot see as acts of malice.",321],"190681":["Mitsue Takeda","Female","b190681-9EopKRJsIZxJ.png","",23],"199022":["Zen Touno","Male","b199022-DhMszO6OYyAH.jpg","",130],"199023":["Gozuka","Male","b199023-1irbgMhSFHOr.png","A man who like cats. Miko gave him a cat she found on the way home.",114],"199024":["Zen's Mother",null,"b199024-ggtiHHNnzDBz.png","",5],"199025":["Touko Yotsuya","Female","b199025-n9YLeaHPUzZQ.png","Mother of Miko and Kyousuke.",64],"199026":["Kyousuke Yotsuya","Male","b199026-pdiaoi3idV9F.png","Miko's younger brother. Kyousuke is a young boy with short black hair. He is very protective of Miko, even going far enough to assume she has a boyfriend to be wary of.",60],"199027":["Satoru","Male","b199027-QfwsUa8PLqzA.png","",2],"250703":["Mamoru Yotsuya","Male","b250703-yLFUyVbzB8aR.png","Father of Miko and Kyousuke.",15],"250705":["Junji Rousoku",null,"b250705-d0g4bdwq1qT0.png","*Parody of ghost story talk show host and personality Junji Inagawa (稲川淳二)*",0],"250706":["Arai","Female","b250706-LXOtjpZSagtC.png","Miko and Hana's teacher.",5],"250707":["Hitoe",null,"b250707-0NgScGk516uu.png","",1],"250708":["Mao",null,"default.jpg","",1],"250710":["Kainushi",null,"default.jpg","",1],"250711